        },
        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "# Bethany: Your Immediate To-Do List for Jacques\n\nThese are the items **Jacques is waiting on from you** before he can move quickly on the new funnel.\n\n## \ud83d\udd34 Priority 1 (Today)\n\n### 1. Finalize the Memberships & Packages Playbook\nThis is the hero product.\n\nReview the current version and:\n- Update it to match your current methodology.\n- Remove anything outdated.\n- Make sure it reflects how you teach memberships today.\n- Don't overthink withholding information. The goal is to sell implementation afterward. \ue200filecite\ue202turn0file0\ue202L257-L271\ue201\n\n---\n\n### 2. Decide the Funnel Products\n\nJacques needs to know exactly what you're selling.\n\nFinalize:\n\n**Hero Offer ($297)**\n- Memberships & Packages Playbook\n\n**Order Bump ($47)**\n- How to Train Your Front Desk & Providers to Sell Memberships\n\n**Upsell ($997)**\nChoose exactly which playbooks go into the implementation bundle.\n\nPossible bundle:\n- Memberships & Packages\n- Sales Conversion\n- Upsell Architecture\n- KPIs\n- SOPs\n- Profitability\n- Retail\n- Operations\n- Laser ROI\n- Team Benchmarks\n\n(You don't have to include everything.) \ue200filecite\ue202turn0file0\ue202L263-L271\ue201\n\n---\n\n### 3. Decide Which Playbooks Stay Exclusive\n\nAnswer:\n\nWhich playbooks should only be available if someone works with Luxora?\n\nJacques needs to know what stays premium versus what goes into the bundle.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Decide Final Pricing\n\nCurrent working idea:\n\n- $297 Hero Offer\n- $47 Order Bump\n- $997 Bundle\n\nConfirm these prices. \ue200filecite\ue202turn0file0\ue202L287-L294\ue201\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udfe0 Priority 2 (Tomorrow)\n\n### 5. Record Two Funnel Videos\n\nJacques is writing the scripts.\n\nOnce you receive them:\n\nRecord:\n- Video #1 (Lead Capture Page)\n- Video #2 (Sales Page)\n\nHe'll handle the rest. \ue200filecite\ue202turn0file0\ue202L225-L236\ue201\n\n---\n\n### 6. Record Gil's New Ad Scripts\n\nYou also have to record:\n- New Meta ad videos\n- Landing page VSL\n\nThese are separate from Jacques' funnel videos. \ue200filecite\ue202turn0file0\ue202L274-L286\ue201\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udfe1 Priority 3\n\n### 7. Review Every Existing Deliverable\n\nGo through every playbook and ask:\n\n- Does this still match how we teach today?\n- Is anything outdated?\n- Is anything missing?\n- Is it premium enough?\n\nThis doesn't need to be perfect, but it should be current. \ue200filecite\ue202turn0file0\ue202L257-L271\ue201\n\n---\n\n### 8. Pick the Free Bonus\n\nWhen someone books a Strategy Call and shows up...\n\nWhat playbook do they receive for free?\n\nChoose one.\n\n---\n\n### 9. Text Natasha\n\nBefore the Amari call:\n\n- Confirm she'll be there.\n- Let her know Jacques will stay on until implementation is complete.\n\nThis was discussed during the meeting. \ue200filecite\ue202turn0file0\ue202L295-L303\ue201\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udfe2 Later This Week\n\n- Meet with Lawrence about the low-ticket/course strategy.\n- Continue developing the webinar.\n- Finish updating the new case studies and one-pager.\n- Continue interviewing closers.\n\n---\n\n# What Jacques Needs From You\n\nIf you hand Jacques these five things, he can build almost everything else:\n\n\u2705 Updated Memberships & Packages Playbook\n\n\u2705 Decision on the $47 Order Bump\n\n\u2705 Decision on what goes in the $997 Bundle\n\n\u2705 Final pricing confirmation\n\n\u2705 Two recorded VSL videos (after he sends scripts)\n\nOnce he has those, he can build the funnel, landing pages, checkout flow, upsells, automation, and nurture sequence while your existing Meta ads continue running. \ue200filecite\ue202turn0file0\ue202L225-L236\ue201"
          ]
        },
